	<TextRow
		Label="msg_w21_swleader8_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でも　おまはんらが　こまっとる
それなら　たすけてやらねば　ならん▽
これが　おいの　やりたいことじゃ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:11:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:07:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>でも　おまはんらが　困っとる
それなら　助けてやらねば　ならん▽
これが　おいの　やりたいことじゃ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:53:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
